{"id": "EUVD-2026-102963", "enisaUuid": "be7134b3-c042-3591-89e5-6b8c44236b44", "description": "Cube-studio through 2026.09.01 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in myapp/views/view_pipeline.py that allows authenticated users to view or copy other project groups' pipelines by id. Attackers can enumerate sequential pipeline ids via the web, log, monitoring, pod, and copy_pipeline endpoints to expose DAGs, cluster names, namespaces, Argo workflow ids, and pod names, or clone pipelines.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:33", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T18:27:10", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/cube-studio-idor-expose-api-lifecycle", "https://github.com/data-infra/cube-studio/blob/v2026.09.01/myapp/views/view_pipeline.py#L1144-L1268", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/cube-studio-through-2026.09.01-idor-via-pipeline-view-and-copy-endpoints"], "aliases": ["GHSA-ww26-7hpw-m38v", "CVE-2026-111672"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.33, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8680a662-4fef-3719-b669-3a94fc8c711c", "product": {"name": "cube-studio", "vendor": {"name": "data-infra"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642026.09.01"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "2f87f25f-1cb4-3484-846c-3cd176994fb4", "vendor": {"name": "data-infra"}}], "isExploited": false}